# KEY|required|visibility|safe_default|prompt|validator
APP_HOST|required|plain|0.0.0.0|Backend listen address|host
APP_PORT|required|plain|8000|Backend port|port
WEBHOOK_TOKEN|required|secret||Webhook token (leave empty to generate one)|token
DATABASE_URL|required|plain|sqlite:////var/lib/work-tracker/work_tracker.db|SQLite database URL|database_url
BROWSER_ALLOWED_ORIGINS|required|plain||BROWSER_ALLOWED_ORIGINS: exact browser URL origins, comma-separated (e.g. http://192.168.1.50:8000; no wildcard or path)|browser_origins
CORS_ORIGINS|optional|plain||Browser CORS origins, comma-separated (empty for same-origin)|cors
SESSION_COOKIE_SECURE|required|plain|false|Secure session cookie (true for HTTPS, false only for trusted LAN HTTP)|boolean
INGRESS_PROFILE|optional|plain|lan|Ingress profile (split only after isolated proxy preparation)|ingress_profile
BROWSER_HSTS_SECONDS|optional|plain|0|HSTS max-age (split HTTPS only, enable after verification)|hsts_seconds
